{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17762","headline":"送澹公归嵩山龙潭寺葬本师 · 杨巨源","name":"送澹公归嵩山龙潭寺葬本师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野烟秋水苍茫远，禅境真机去住闲。\n双树爲家思旧壑，千花成塔礼寒山。\n洞宫曾向龙边宿，云径应从鸟外还。\n莫恋本师金骨地，空门无处复无关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17762.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17762","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}